{"resultsCount":1,"resultsLimit":10,"resultsOffset":0,"headlines":[{"id":40699880,"nowId":"1-40699880","contentKey":"40699880-1-6-1","dataSourceIdentifier":"3b5ddc54255df","publishedkey":"40699880","type":"Story","feedDisplayType":"Default","headline":"Fantasy football buzz: Top scorers through Sunday Night Football","description":"A closer look at the leading fantasy scorers of the day, from Jahmyr Gibbs and Jaxon Smith-Njigba to Geno Smith and Garrett Wilson.","title":"Fantasy football buzz: Top scorers through Sunday Night Football","linkText":"Fantasy football buzz: Top scorers through Sunday Night Football","categorized":"2026-09-28T03:55:29Z","originallyPosted":"2026-09-28T03:53:00Z","lastModified":"2026-09-28T03:55:24Z","published":"2026-09-28T03:55:24Z","root":"ffl/2026","section":"Fantasy","images":[{"dataSourceIdentifier":"4a972f19d03ae","id":50046170,"type":"header","name":"Jaxon Smith-Njigba [1296x729]","caption":"Jaxon Smith-Njigba is again one of the top scorers of the week.","alt":"Seahawks wide receiver Jaxon Smith-Njigba (11) celebrates after a Seahawks touchdown during the Seattle Seahawks versus Washington Commanders National Football League game at Northwest Stadium on September 27, 2026 in Landover, MD.","credit":"Randy Litzinger/Icon Sportswire","height":729,"width":1296,"url":"https://a.espncdn.com/photo/2026/0927/r1722643_1296x729_16-9.jpg"},{"dataSourceIdentifier":"ef9d4c92f9270","id":50027096,"type":"header","name":"Bijan Robinson photodesk [1296x729]","caption":"Michael Penix Jr. had Bijan Robinson and the Falcons offense firing on all cylinders on Thursday night.","credit":"Geoff Stellfox/Getty Images","height":729,"width":1296,"url":"https://a.espncdn.com/photo/2026/0925/r1721660_1296x729_16-9.jpg"},{"dataSourceIdentifier":"f19ed296a132b","id":50022743,"type":"header","name":"Malik Nabers [1296x864]","caption":"Malik Nabers hurt a shoulder Monday night but expects to be available Sunday against the Titans.","alt":"Malik Nabers","credit":"Gary A. Vasquez/Imagn Images","height":864,"width":1296,"url":"https://a.espncdn.com/photo/2026/0924/r1721426_1296x864_3-2.jpg"},{"dataSourceIdentifier":"4d3ae484679ca","id":50013229,"type":"header","name":"Jared Goff [1296x729]","caption":"If injuries have upended the quarterback position on your fantasy roster, consider picking up Lions QB Jared Goff.","alt":"Jared Goff #16 of the Detroit Lions throws a pass against the Buffalo Bills during the second quarter of the game at Highmark Stadium on September 17, 2026 in Orchard Park, New York.","credit":"Timothy T Ludwig/Getty Images","height":729,"width":1296,"url":"https://a.espncdn.com/photo/2026/0923/r1720827_1296x729_16-9.jpg"},{"dataSourceIdentifier":"f69a15bd7dfd0","id":50013585,"type":"header","name":"Jonathan Brooks [1296x729]","caption":"With Panthers RB Jonathon Brooks on IR, fantasy managers should pivot their attention to Chuba Hubbard.","alt":"Carolina running back Jonathon Brooks (25) warms up prior to the start of the NFL game between the Carolina Panthers and the Atlanta Falcons on September 20th, 2026 at Mercedes-Benz Stadium in Atlanta, GA.","credit":"Rich von Biberstein/Icon Sportswire","height":729,"width":1296,"url":"https://a.espncdn.com/photo/2026/0923/r1720860_1296x729_16-9.jpg"},{"dataSourceIdentifier":"80605bed36809","id":50005278,"type":"header","name":"Jaxson Dart and Malik Nabers [608x342]","caption":"Malik Nabers and the rest of the Giants' skill position players take a hit with Jaxson Dart injured.","alt":"Jaxson Dart and Malik Nabers","credit":"AP Photo/Caroline Brehman","height":342,"width":608,"url":"https://a.espncdn.com/photo/2026/0922/r1720392_608x342_16-9.jpg"},{"dataSourceIdentifier":"e7023f64567d1","id":50007790,"type":"header","name":"Tyson Bagent [1296x729]","caption":"With the news that Tyson Bagent is in concussion protocol, there's uncertainty over who will start for the Bears in Week 4.","alt":"Tyson Bagent #17 of the Chicago Bears looks to pass against the Minnesota Vikings during the fourth quarter of the game at Soldier Field on September 20, 2026 in Chicago, Illinois.","credit":"Geoff Stellfox/Getty Images","height":729,"width":1296,"url":"https://a.espncdn.com/photo/2026/0922/r1720543_1296x729_16-9.jpg"},{"dataSourceIdentifier":"219743be70090","id":49999962,"type":"header","name":"Kyler Murray [1296x729]","caption":"The Minnesota Vikings announced that Kyler Murray will start in Week 3.","credit":"AP Photo/Bailey Hillesheim","height":729,"width":1296,"url":"https://a.espncdn.com/photo/2026/0921/r1720117_1296x729_16-9.jpg"},{"dataSourceIdentifier":"8de1bc3448a5a","id":49998383,"type":"header","name":"Travis Etienne Jr. [1296x729]","caption":"Travis Etienne Jr. of the New Orleans Saints was started in 78.2% of ESPN leagues.","credit":"Patrick Smith/Getty Images","height":729,"width":1296,"url":"https://a.espncdn.com/photo/2026/0921/r1720009_1296x729_16-9.jpg"},{"dataSourceIdentifier":"34df5c0ee8a19","id":49994285,"type":"header","name":"Jaxon Smith-Njigba [1296x729]","caption":"Jaxon Smith-Njigba found the end zone three times against the Cardinals.","alt":"Seattle Seahawks wide receiver Jaxon Smith-Njigba, left, scores a touchdown against Arizona Cardinals safety Budda Baker, right, during the second half of an NFL football game in Glendale, Ariz., Sunday, Sept. 20, 2026.","credit":"AP Photo/Ross D. Franklin","height":729,"width":1296,"url":"https://a.espncdn.com/photo/2026/0920/r1719791_1296x729_16-9.jpg"}],"related":[{"id":49949224,"dataSourceIdentifier":"3c0a24d09f2f5","publishedkey":"49949224","type":"Story","headline":"Rest-of-season rankings: Walker, Shough on the rise while Maye, McConkey fall","title":"Rest-of-season rankings: Walker, Shough on the rise while Maye, McConkey fall","linkText":"Rest-of-season rankings: Kenneth Walker III rises, Drake Maye slips","images":[{"dataSourceIdentifier":"31b1204d55d93","id":50007393,"type":"header","name":"Kenneth Walker III [1296x729]","caption":"Kenneth Walker III has played like one of the top players in fantasy through the first two weeks.","alt":"Kenneth Walker III #9 of the Kansas City Chiefs runs with the ball in overtime of an NFL game between the Indianapolis Colts and Kansas City Chiefs on Sep 20, 2026 at Arrowhead Stadium in Kansas City, MO.Kenneth Walker III","credit":"Scott Winters/Icon Sportswire","height":729,"width":1296,"url":"https://a.espncdn.com/photo/2026/0922/r1720529_1296x729_16-9.jpg"}],"byline":"Eric Karabell","isLiveBlog":false,"links":{"api":{"self":{"href":"https://content.core.api.espn.com/v1/sports/news/49949224"}},"app":{"sportscenter":{"href":"sportscenter://x-callback-url/showStory?uid=49949224"}},"mobile":{"href":"http://m.espn.go.com/wireless/story?storyId=49949224"},"web":{"href":"https://www.espn.com/fantasy/football/story/_/id/49949224/fantasy-football-2026-updated-rest-season-rankings"}},"premium":false},{"id":49991137,"dataSourceIdentifier":"b39dc2b89ded7","publishedkey":"FFSundayHighLows-49991137","type":"Story","headline":"Week 2 winners and losers: Jaxon Smith-Njigba, CeeDee Lamb shine; Bijan Robinson struggles","title":"Week 2 winners and losers: Jaxon Smith-Njigba, CeeDee Lamb shine; Bijan Robinson struggles","linkText":"Week 2 winners and losers: JSN, Lamb shine; Robinson, Jefferson struggle","ads":[{"pageName":"FFSundayHighLows-49991137"}],"pageName":"FFSundayHighLows-49991137","images":[{"dataSourceIdentifier":"af1e9b1fbd7ff","id":49994521,"type":"header","name":"CeeDee Lamb [1296x729]","caption":"CeeDee Lamb had 153 yards receiving and a pair of touchdowns in the win over the Commanders.","alt":"Dallas Cowboys wide receiver Ceedee Lamb (88) reacts in the first half against the Washington Commanders during an NFL football game in Arlington, Texas, Sunday, Sept. 20, 2026.","credit":"AP Photo/Tony Gutierrez","height":729,"width":1296,"url":"https://a.espncdn.com/photo/2026/0920/r1719798_2_1296x729_16-9.jpg"}],"byline":"Matt Bowen and Tristan H. Cockcroft","isLiveBlog":false,"links":{"api":{"self":